WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.920
Recipe says one level teaspoon.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.700
My professional measurement is one heaped
spoon of chicken.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.460
That’s not a measurement, that’s a
preference.

